WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
How is this so embarrassing?

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,480
It's okay. I don't want it anyway.

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,680
Boss thank you

4
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,600
You are so kind

5
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,640
Then we'll leave first

6
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,780
Where shall we go tomorrow?

7
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,180
I'll go get the business card tomorrow

8
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,100
The business cards are all ready

9
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,700
After we get it, we'll hand out business cards and that's it.

10
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,140
It's getting late now and I have to go back

11
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,340
My back hurts all day

12
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:26,780
I have to go back and have a good rest. I still have quilts when I go back.

13
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,380
Have you counted all the clothes I asked you to count before? Have you counted them?

14
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,160
Count our clothes and at the same time

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,440
Can you give me some quilts? Can I give them out today?

16
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:35,720
Yes, I'll send it today

17
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,160
The weather is getting colder now

18
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,600
If you can send it to everyone, send it to everyone.

19
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,320
Let everyone be able to resist the cold as early as possible

20
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,440
Especially the elderly and children

21
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,600
I can't stand this cold weather

22
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,240
Our requirements here are very simple

23
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,120
If you have elderly children at home, you can get quilts.

24
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,280
Just try not to give away clothes

25
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,720
Okay, I'll arrange it later

26
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:52,160
It shouldn't be a big problem for the time being, General.

27
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,720
We don't have enough oil here.

28
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,320
Did the iron horse drink oil?

29
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,520
We often run around outside during these times.

30
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,480
I need to find and pick up people again.

31
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,680
So the oil is consumed very quickly

32
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:00,680
Is it easy for you to get oil over there?

33
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,720
Otherwise, this iron horse won't be able to run, no problem

34
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,920
I'll go back and get some oil, okay?

35
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:06,520
When you have time, go dig a place.

36
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,440
I'll try to get some more oil here for us.

37
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,760
When the time comes, let’s store it underground.
